We are looking for an experienced Arabic Cuisine & Grill Chef with strong expertise in Middle Eastern cuisine and grilled food. ", "content2": "<p><strong>Job Title: Arabic Cuisine &amp; Grill Chef</strong></p><p>We are looking for an experienced and skilled <strong>Chef</strong> to join our team.</p><p><strong>Requirements:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Open to <strong>Arabic or any other nationality</strong> with strong experience in <strong>Arabic cuisine and grilled food</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Proven experience in preparing <strong>Middle Eastern and Arabic dishes</strong>, especially <strong>charcoal grills, kebabs, kofta, chicken, and other grilled items</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Strong knowledge of food preparation, cooking techniques, and kitchen hygiene.</p></li><li><p>Able to maintain consistent <strong>food quality, taste, and presentation</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Good understanding of kitchen operations and working in a fast-paced restaurant environment.</p></li><li><p>Team player with good communication and leadership skills.</p></li><li><p>Creative, responsible, and passionate about food.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Main Responsibilities:</strong></p><ul><li><p>Prepare and cook Arabic and Middle Eastern dishes according to the restaurant’s standards.</p></li><li><p>Handle and manage the grill station efficiently.</p></li><li><p>Ensure consistent quality, taste, portioning, and presentation.</p></li><li><p>Maintain high standards of cleanliness, food safety, and kitchen organization.</p></li><li><p>Work closely with the restaurant management team to ensure smooth kitchen operations.</p></li></ul><p><br></p>", "status": "Active", "isExpired": false, "isLinkOut": false, "isVerified": true, "expiresAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-08-25T13:59:59.999Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "listedAt": {"dateTimeUtc": "2026-07-26T05:30:44.287Z", "__typename": "SeekDateTime"}, "salary": {"currencyLabel": null, "label": "Rp 5.000.000 – Rp 7.000.000 per month", "__typename": "JobSal